        "text_FC9JiFwLV5r02XAz": "<p>Portable and stylish </p><p>for on-the-go use.</p>",
        "text_k524sTZ6ZbDjkkO8": "<p>Free</p>",
        "text_4SRFcGqWrMxnIYv1": "<p>Affiliate Access</p>",
        "text_IVqP5qSW3r0hO4sS": "<p>Help others live healthier lives,</p><p>while you earn money!</p>",
        "text_EEzj7vVzmSUwglSP": "<h3>Any Questions?</h3>",
        "text_Rr6gJuFSOan5Sdaf": "<h3>We&apos;ve got answers</h3>",
        "text_lfafmJm8rQCNXXqA": "<p><strong>What does flavoured air taste like?</strong></p>",
        "text_35ROgNuTm0wayOTR": "<p>Lio’s flavoured air provides a subtle, natural taste designed to help you quit smoking or vaping. </p><p></p><p>It’s less intense than vapor but refreshing, similar to a lightly infused herbal tea or soda without the sweetness.</p>",
        "text_Z4D4X2cMJjDsx5Mo": "<p><strong>How does Lio work?</strong></p>",
        "text_3W2nfUnCqOQ3JWNt": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored air to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it keeps the hand-to-mouth habit for an easy transition. </p><p></p><p>Trusted by 50,000+ customers and backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee, it’s the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>",
        "text_NXMnsIiyleh9MA6Z": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_MBoS4KsMVwska6vL": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings.</p></li></ol>",
        "text_BbdUbsFK23wYdseQ": "<p><strong>Money Back Guarantee</strong></p>",
        "text_fN3ZZqFqOO0sn8E9": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_BdsfvMtTKwgUq3hT": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_uMMlIgQIoG0xCXae": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_sMxjhPFajjsnnOIf": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>",
        "text_r5tcdtbMU7W9wTtU": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_TfLEjiOSqmpbj8g7": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>",
        "text_q2UaGYffdYMIMoHL": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>",
        "text_C328rQSQHnvENIZt": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_qeUjwinOUHGzaVOS": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
